---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="The Walkthrough — Sustainabox">

	<div class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>The 4-Hour Walkthrough</h1>
			<p>A recorded tour of the complete build. From foundation to finishes. Learn what works, what we'd do differently, and why.</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<section class="container content-section">
		<h2>What You Get</h2>
		<p>A 4-hour recorded walkthrough of the Sustainabox property. You get the same knowledge transfer as an in-person visit—at your own pace, whenever you want.</p>

		<div class="walkthrough-sections">
			<div class="section-card">
				<h3>🏗️ Foundation & Site</h3>
				<p>Pier foundation design, site preparation, why we chose this approach, and what we'd do differently.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="section-card">
				<h3>📦 Container Modification</h3>
				<p>Cutting openings, reinforcing the structure, integrating MEP systems. The engineering behind the decisions.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="section-card">
				<h3>⚡ Electrical Systems</h3>
				<p>Main panel, circuits, load calculations, grounding. How we designed for efficiency and resilience.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="section-card">
				<h3>💧 Plumbing & Water</h3>
				<p>Supply lines, fixtures, septic integration, water management. Real costs and maintenance realities.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="section-card">
				<h3>🌡️ Thermal & HVAC</h3>
				<p>Insulation strategy, ventilation, temperature control. How container design challenges were solved.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="section-card">
				<h3>🏠 Interiors & Finishes</h3>
				<p>Layout decisions, materials selection, storage design. Making 750 sq ft feel spacious and functional.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Why Video Instead of Cohort?</h2>
		<div class="why-box">
			<p>We realized the real value isn't in a multi-week course structure—it's in seeing the actual systems and decisions. A recorded walkthrough lets you:</p>
			<ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-top: 1rem;">
				<li>✓ Pause and take notes whenever you want</li>
				<li>✓ Rewatch specific sections multiple times</li>
				<li>✓ Learn at your own pace (4 hours total)</li>
				<li>✓ No scheduling conflicts or live call pressure</li>
				<li>✓ Combine with the in-person experience if you stay with us</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Best Way to Learn</h2>
		<div class="learning-options">
			<div class="option">
				<h3>📺 Video Only</h3>
				<p><strong>$49</strong></p>
				<p>Watch the 4-hour recorded walkthrough. Lifetime access. Download available.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="option featured">
				<h3>🏡 + Stay at Sustainabox</h3>
				<p><strong>$599–$799</strong></p>
				<p>Weekend visit with in-person 4-hour walkthrough + recorded version + templates + community access.</p>
				<p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.9;"><em>Recommended: Learn the systems in video, then experience them live.</em></p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">What's Included (Video)</h2>
		<ul class="included-list">
			<li>✓ 4-hour recorded walkthrough (HD video)</li>
			<li>✓ Lifetime access + download option</li>
			<li>✓ PDF reference guide with diagrams and specs</li>
			<li>✓ Cost breakdown spreadsheet</li>
			<li>✓ Material list and suppliers</li>
			<li>✓ Design files & sketches</li>
			<li>✓ Access to resource library (updates included)</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Future: YouTube & More</h2>
		<p style="color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.8;">We're exploring expanded educational content: YouTube series, podcast interviews, deeper dives on specific systems. Video and audio formats we're learning to produce with AI tools. The walkthrough is the foundation; we're building on it from there.</p>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Who This Is For</h2>
		<ul class="audience-list">
			<li>People designing their first container home (DIY or with pros)</li>
			<li>Architects and designers entering the alternative housing space</li>
			<li>Anyone curious about resilient design principles and real execution</li>
			<li>Remote learners who want depth without cohort commitment</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Who's Teaching</h2>

		<div class="instructor-grid instructor-grid-3">
			<div class="instructor-card">
				<img src="/images/jen-instructor.jpg" alt="Jen Swidler" class="instructor-photo" />
				<h3>Jen Swidler</h3>
				<p class="role">Homebuilding Expert · General Contractor</p>
				<p>Started as a homeowner who hired and managed architects and contractors for a custom build in Evergreen, Colorado. Then transitioned to work for the home builder as a consultant for 6 years, managing every aspect of the Sustainabox project: subcontractor coordination, scheduling, cost control, timeline, quality. Brings both owner and professional perspectives.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="instructor-card">
				<img src="/images/cody-instructor.jpg" alt="Cody Swidler" class="instructor-photo" />
				<h3>Cody Swidler</h3>
				<p class="role">Enterprise Resilience · Design Strategy</p>
				<p>15+ years in enterprise resilience and risk management. Brought the design thinking, systems approach, and risk mitigation to the project. Contributed hands-on labor throughout the build. The "why" behind the design decisions and the "how" of resilient systems.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="instructor-card">
				<img src="/images/PXL_20260429_163445724.MP.jpg.jpeg" alt="Skye" class="instructor-photo" />
				<h3>Skye</h3>
				<p class="role">Design · Labor · Content Creator</p>
				<p>Contributed design work and hands-on labor throughout the project. Content creator for Travel365 and more. Brings the storytelling and visual perspective to how the build comes alive. The bridge between the technical execution and the lived experience.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="cta-box">
			<h3>Ready to Learn?</h3>
			<p>Get the video walkthrough or combine it with an in-person stay.</p>
			<a href="/stays" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Stay Packages</a>
			<p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8;">Video-only purchases available on Gumroad (link coming soon)</p>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: var(--color-navy);
		color: white;
		padding: 4rem 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.page-header p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	.content-section {
		padding: 3rem 0;
	}

	.content-section h2 {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 1rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-blue);
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.content-section p {
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.walkthrough-sections {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.section-card {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.section-card h3 {
		color: var(--color-blue);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.section-card p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.why-box {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.why-box ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.why-box li {
		padding: 0.5rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.why-box li::before {
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.learning-options {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.option {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.option.featured {
		border-left-color: var(--color-rust);
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-warm), rgba(192, 86, 33, 0.05));
		transform: scale(1.05);
	}

	.option h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.option p:nth-of-type(2) {
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		margin: 1rem 0;
	}

	.option p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.included-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.included-list li {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 1rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--color-blue);
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.audience-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.audience-list li {
		padding: 0.5rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.audience-list li::before {
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-weight: bold;
		content: "•";
	}

	.instructor-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.instructor-grid-3 {
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
	}

	.instructor-card {
		background: var(--color-warm);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.instructor-photo {
		width: 100%;
		height: 350px;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 4px;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		display: block;
	}

	.instructor-card h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
		font-size: 1.3rem;
	}

	.instructor-card .role {
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 1rem !important;
	}

	.instructor-card p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.cta-box {
		background: var(--color-blue);
		color: white;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}

	.cta-box h3 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.cta-box p {
		color: white;
		opacity: 0.95;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.cta-box .btn {
		background: white;
		color: var(--color-blue);
	}

	.cta-box .btn:hover {
		background: var(--color-sky);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.option.featured {
			transform: scale(1);
		}

		.walkthrough-sections {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.learning-options {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.included-list {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
